              "kind": "text",
              "key": "q9_4",
              "accepted": [
                "Helical Gear — High pitch velocity (18 m/s) and continuous 24/7 duty require high Barth factor (Cv), multi-tooth load sharing, and low dynamic excitation for fatigue durability"
              ]
            },
